@database MultiRename
@author Uwe Rosner
@wordwrap
@node Main "MultiRename - Introduction"

@{fg shine}MultiRename 1.0 released on 01.10.2025.@{fg text}

@{b}@{u}About@{uu}@{ub}

MultiRename is a tool to rename the contents (files and directories) within one directory according to a specified mask. It is inspired by the MultiRename tool of the Windows tool TotalCommander, but it does not have all of its features.

Many thanks to Mason for creating the beautiful color icon for MultiRename in AmigaOS 3.2 style!

If you encounter any problems with this tool, please feel free to send me a brief report, Uwe Rosner (u.rosner@ymail.com).

